{"id":149799081304448,"type":"artist","name":"Grant Lee Buffalo","artist":null,"year":1991,"weight":17,"info":{"country":"US","begin":"1991","end":"1998","kind":"Group","similar":["Grant-Lee Phillips","Buffalo Tom","Afghan Whigs","Grinderman","Mark Lanegan","Isobel Campbell & Mark Lanegan","Madrugada","The Walkabouts","dEUS","The Lemonheads"],"img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Grant-Lee_Phillips_in_Concert_2009-11-20.jpg?width=500","bio":"Grant Lee Buffalo es una banda de rock creada en Los Ángeles\n\nLos tres integrantes ya habían estado antes en una banda de Los Ángeles, Shiva Burlesque. Como Grant Lee Buffalo lanzaron cuatro trabajos musicales, Fuzzy, Mighty Joe Moon, Copperopolis y Jubilee, este último sin Kimble, ya que éste había dejado la banda años atras.\n\nEn los Estados Unidos puede ser recordada por su single de 1998 Truly, Truly que tuvo gran éxito en esos años. Después de la salida del ultimo disco","tags":["alternative","rock","americana","singer-songwriter","alternative rock"]},"works":[{"id":270628522395524,"type":"song","name":"Dixie Drug Store","artist":"Grant Lee Buffalo","year":1993,"weight":2,"yt":"iSWCVUW_Neo","src":"singles","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":84131689374921,"name":"Triple J Hottest 100 · 1993","rank":88,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":67257795632096,"type":"album","name":"Fuzzy","artist":"Grant Lee Buffalo","year":1993,"weight":23,"yt":"nfIaRchAdkc","src":"books,charts,musthear","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":59251635065665,"name":"Sputnikmusic Best Albums 1993","rank":117,"scaruffi":7.5},{"id":192934750972716,"name":"1001 Albums You Must Hear Before You Die","rank":740,"scaruffi":7.5},{"id":13018320481353,"name":"Scaruffi 1990s","rank":229,"scaruffi":7.5},{"id":103254340346721,"name":"RYM Top — Regional Music — Americana","rank":44,"scaruffi":7.5}],"n_lists":6}},{"id":143363792525495,"ty